      "elements": [
        {
          "element_id": "subtitle_scene_01",
          "scene_id": "scene_01",
          "text": "Milk is just water, protein, fat, vitamins, and sugar. But cheesemaking transforms it into something totally different.",
          "t_start_s": 0.0,
          "t_end_s": 7.15,
          "position": {
            "x": "center",
            "y": 0.75
          },
          "style": {
            "font": "Montserrat-Bold",
            "size": 72,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "stroke": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "width": 4
            },
            "shadow": {
              "blur": 8,
              "opacity": 0.8
            }
          },
          "animation": {
            "in": {
              "type": "fade_up",
              "duration_s": 0.3
            },
            "out": {
              "type": "fade",
              "duration_s": 0.2
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "element_id": "subtitle_scene_02",
          "scene_id": "scene_02",
          "text": "Enzymes break down the milk—basically mimicking your stomach's digestive process.",
          "t_start_s": 7.15,
          "t_end_s": 11.47,
          "position": {
            "x": "center",
            "y": 0.75
          },
          "style": {
            "font": "Montserrat-Bold",
            "size": 72,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "stroke": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "width": 4
            },
            "shadow": {
              "blur": 8,
              "opacity": 0.8
            }
          },
          "animation": {
            "in": {
              "type": "fade_up",
              "duration_s": 0.3
            },
            "out": {
              "type": "fade",
              "duration_s": 0.2
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "element_id": "subtitle_scene_03",
          "scene_id": "scene_03",
          "text": "The lactose drains away with the whey, while fat, vitamins, and minerals stay with the protein curds.",
          "t_start_s": 11.47,
          "t_end_s": 17.23,
          "position": {
            "x": "center",
            "y": 0.75
          },
          "style": {
            "font": "Montserrat-Bold",
            "size": 72,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "stroke": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "width": 4
            },
            "shadow": {
              "blur": 8,
              "opacity": 0.8
            }
          },
          "animation": {
            "in": {
              "type": "fade_up",
              "duration_s": 0.3
            },
            "out": {
              "type": "fade",
              "duration_s": 0.2
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "element_id": "subtitle_scene_04",
          "scene_id": "scene_04",
          "text": "Then comes the magic: controlled growth of bacteria, molds, and yeast during aging. These microbes are added during processing, rubbed on rinds, or applied through washing liquids.",
          "t_start_s": 17.23,
          "t_end_s": 27.35,
          "position": {
            "x": "center",
            "y": 0.75
          },
          "style": {
            "font": "Montserrat-Bold",
            "size": 72,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "stroke": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "width": 4
            },
            "shadow": {
              "blur": 8,
              "opacity": 0.8
            }
          },
          "animation": {
            "in": {
              "type": "fade_up",
              "duration_s": 0.3
            },
            "out": {
              "type": "fade",
              "duration_s": 0.2
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "element_id": "subtitle_scene_05",
          "scene_id": "scene_05",
          "text": "That bright orange grocery store cheddar? It's colored with annatto from the tropical achiote tree—not naturally orange at all.",
          "t_start_s": 27.35,
          "t_end_s": 33.9,
          "position": {
            "x": "center",
            "y": 0.75
          },
          "style": {
            "font": "Montserrat-Bold",
            "size": 72,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "stroke": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "width": 4
            },
            "shadow": {
              "blur": 8,
              "opacity": 0.8
            }
          },
          "animation": {
            "in": {
              "type": "fade_up",
              "duration_s": 0.3
            },
            "out": {
              "type": "fade",
              "duration_s": 0.2
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "element_id": "subtitle_scene_06",
          "scene_id": "scene_06",
          "text": "Humans have been perfecting this chemistry for thousands of years. What's your favorite cheese?",
